Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 22:18:49 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] World model service tools in the MCP catalog

The world_model_* tools reach the Axelrod world model service (the causal model) for the signed-in org user:
reads pinned to a state version, a company's business construction and traces, forecasts, ingesting a project
source, and proposing a bundle's graph updates for human review. No tool approves a world model change.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
